{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"469","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Chat Online"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Little X and Little Z are good friends. They always chat online. But both of them have schedules."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Little Z has fixed schedule. He always online at any moment of time between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b1"},{"kind":"text","text":", between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a2"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b2"},{"kind":"text","text":", ..., between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ap"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bp"},{"kind":"text","text":" (all borders inclusive). But the schedule of Little X is quite strange, it depends on the time when he gets up. If he gets up at time "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":", he will be online at any moment of time between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d1"},{"kind":"text","text":", between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c2"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d2"},{"kind":"text","text":", ..., between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"cq"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"dq"},{"kind":"text","text":" (all borders inclusive). But if he gets up at time "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":", these segments will be shifted by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":". They become "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[ci + t, di + t]"},{"kind":"text","text":" (for all "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If at a moment of time, both Little X and Little Z are online simultaneosly, they can chat online happily. You know that Little X can get up at an integer moment of time between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":" (both borders inclusive). Also you know that Little X wants to get up at the moment of time, that is suitable for chatting with Little Z (they must have at least one common moment of time in schedules). How many integer moments of time from the segment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l, r]"},{"kind":"text","text":" suit for that?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains four space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p, q, l, r"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤  p, q ≤ 50; 0 ≤ l ≤ r ≤ 1000"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contains two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai, bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ ai < bi ≤ 1000"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Each of the next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contains two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"cj, dj"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ cj < dj ≤ 1000"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It's guaranteed that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi < ai + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"dj < cj + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" for all valid "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer — the number of moments of time from the segment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l, r]"},{"kind":"text","text":" which suit for online conversation."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 1 0 4\n2 3\n0 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 3 0 20\n15 17\n23 26\n1 4\n7 11\n15 17\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"20\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"469B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/469/problem/B"}